I'm restarting my "jefnuz" (Weekly News) project.  This time I hope
the main focus will be events that are experienced by or observed by
Lojbanists.  I'd like to learn more about all of you, and have events
from all our lives shared as a community.  Feel free to help edit the
next issue, which will be published next Sunday:

https://docs.google.com/document/edit?id=1wuXweTW7NS-cdqNsuxI0zdXnpC_cteBjw5LC2daDksY&hl=en&authkey=CKyXp8IL

There are sections so far in Lojban and English, and I'd love to see
sections in other languages as well, even if I don't understand them.
:)

mi'e .telselkik. mu'o

